  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Thinly slice the onion. Trim the beans, then halve on an angle. Halve the tomatoes. Finely chop the parsley leaves and stems. Drain and rinse the lentils.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/155358/photos/large/prep_ingredients-ea9ee4b1a5c5526ae70e33cb7aef898e.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Marinate onion: Bring a small saucepan of water to the boil for the beans. Put the onion, 1 tbs red wine vinegar and 2 tsp honey in a large bowl. Season with salt and pepper and stir to combine. Set aside to marinate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/155359/photos/large/pickle_the_onion-883e5b205676a495609b2349ee871d51.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook beans: Cook the beans in the pan of boiling water for 2-3 mins until tender. Drain and rinse under cold water. Meanwhile, put the walnuts in a cold medium frypan over medium heat. Toast, tossing, for 3-4 mins until evenly golden. Remove from the pan and cool slightly, then coarsely chop.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/155360/photos/large/cook_beans-0198c29144118f10e247277d7e020210.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Toss salad: Add the lentils, beans, tomatoes, parsley leaves and stems and 1 tbs olive oil to the onion mixture and toss to combine. Taste, then season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/155361/photos/large/toss_salad-8534d1a6ece0c5833423458d5814c8af.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Divide the salad among bowls. Scatter over the walnuts, crumble over the feta and enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/155362/photos/large/serve_up-1f9c0fe0e76e75306dab6e98173c33ce.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it yours: Extra fresh herbs are a delicious addition to this salad. If you have some mint or basil from the garden, finely chop the leaves and stir through.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/155363/photos/large/make_it_yours-16d24f6bda92b4aa081c361b7ed2f40b.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
